  "purpose": "One frozen delivery-support server/client batch. Only the exact 403 window_support_required response pauses automatic reservation of prepared photos; their encrypted data remains available for explicit retry. Existing accepted deliveries continue, and 503 window_support_unavailable remains a transient verification failure. Authorization, lifecycle tokens, author identity and revocation boundaries are preserved. Both enforcement defaults remain off. Build/privacy/disabled-feature checks, real Photos permission and scanning, runtime on both OS versions, and three native delivery/family-record operations remain required. Gallery is omitted only because its render/selection inputs and Widget target membership are unchanged. The separate existing Sharing Service workflow must still pass all three jobs. Native rendering and server execution have not yet been verified for this candidate. This first scope is unmeasured and is not main-promotion or TestFlight evidence by itself.",
